$ curl -s 'http://localhost:8081/health'
  [2026-06-19 22:05:27] HEALTH replica2 -> HTTP 200 [OK]  round_trip=2.7ms  body={"replica": "replica2", "status": "ok", "time": "2026-06-19T18:35:27Z"}
$ curl -s 'http://localhost:8082/health'
